{"page":224,"verses":[{"verse_key":"11:20","surah":11,"ayah":20,"ar_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ لَمْ يَكُونُوا۟ مُعْجِزِينَ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ وَمَا كَانَ لَهُم مِّن دُونِ ٱللَّهِ مِنْ أَوْلِيَآءَ ۘ يُضَـٰعَفُ لَهُمُ ٱلْعَذَابُ ۚ مَا كَانُوا۟ يَسْتَطِيعُونَ ٱلسَّمْعَ وَمَا كَانُوا۟ يُبْصِرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They will not escape on earth, and there will be no one other than God to protect them. Their punishment will be doubled. They could not hear, and they did not see.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"Those","transliteration":"ulāika","verse_key":"11:20"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَمْ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"11:20"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَكُونُوا۟","en_gloss":"will be","transliteration":"yakūnū","verse_key":"11:20"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مُعْجِزِينَ","en_gloss":"(able to) escape","transliteration":"muʿ'jizīna","verse_key":"11:20"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"11:20"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"11:20"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"11:20"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"is","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"11:20"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَهُم","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"11:20"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"besides","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"11:20"},{"pos":11,"ar":"دُونِ","en_gloss":"besides","transliteration":"dūni","verse_key":"11:20"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"11:20"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"11:20"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَوْلِيَآءَ ۘ","en_gloss":"protectors","transliteration":"awliyāa","verse_key":"11:20"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يُضَـٰعَفُ","en_gloss":"And will be doubled","transliteration":"yuḍāʿafu","verse_key":"11:20"},{"pos":16,"ar":"لَهُمُ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahumu","verse_key":"11:20"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱ