1"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٢١","en_gloss":"(21)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"11:21"}]},{"verse_key":"11:22","surah":11,"ayah":22,"ar_uthmani":"لَا جَرَمَ أَنَّهُمْ فِى ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ هُمُ ٱلْأَخْسَرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"There is no doubt they will be the ones to lose most in the life to come.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"No","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"11:22"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جَرَمَ","en_gloss":"doubt","transliteration":"jarama","verse_key":"11:22"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"that they","transliteration":"annahum","verse_key":"11:22"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"11:22"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","en_gloss":"the Hereafter","transliteration":"l-ākhirati","verse_key":"11:22"},{"pos":6,"ar":"هُمُ","en_gloss":"[they]","transliteration":"humu","verse_key":"11:22"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْأَخْسَرُونَ","en_gloss":"(will be) the greatest losers","transliteration":"l-akhsarūna","verse_key":"11:22"},{"pos":8,"ar":"٢٢","en_gloss":"(22)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"11:22"}]},{"verse_key":"11:23","surah":11,"ayah":23,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَعَمِلُوا۟ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ وَأَخْبَتُوٓا۟ إِلَىٰ رَبِّهِمْ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ أَصْحَـٰبُ ٱلْجَنَّةِ ۖ هُمْ فِيهَا خَـٰلِدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But those who believed, did good deeds, and humbled themselves before their Lord will be companions in Paradise and there they will stay.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"11:23"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"11:23"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"11:23"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","en_gloss":"and do","transliteration":"waʿamilū","verse_key":"11:23"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"good deeds","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","verse_key":"11:23"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَأَخْبَتُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"and humble themsel